{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\n\nRemove them manually (for files in /etc/sudoers.d, run “sudo rm <path>” in Terminal), or fix the cause and choose Uninstall LidAwake… again.\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nRemove them manually (for files in /etc/sudoers.d, run “sudo rm <path>” in Terminal), or fix the cause and choose Uninstall LidAwake… again.\n\n"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nУдалите их вручную (для файлов в /etc/sudoers.d выполните в Терминале «sudo rm <путь>») или устраните причину и снова выберите «Удалить LidAwake…».\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Nothing else was removed, but Launch at Login is now off; turn it back on from the menu.": {
