    "LidAwake needs an administrator to install its sleep rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake needs an administrator to install its sleep rule."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake нужно разрешение администратора, чтобы установить правило управления сном."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake needs an administrator to remove its sleep rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake needs an administrator to remove its sleep rule."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake нужно разрешение администратора, чтобы удалить правило управления сном."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake needs attention"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake требует внимания"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake restores normal sleep, then removes:\n• its sleep rules /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake-%@ and, if it names this account, /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake (macOS asks for an administrator password)\n• its login item\n• its settings and ~/Library/Application Support/LidAwake\n• the app itself, moved to the Trash\n\nThen LidAwake quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake restores normal sleep, then removes:\n• its sleep rules /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake-%@ and, if it names this account, /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake (macOS asks for an administrator password)\n• its login item\n• its settings and ~/Library/Application Support/LidAwake\n• the app itself, moved to the Trash\n\nThen LidAwake quits."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake восстановит обычный сон, затем удалит:\n• свои правила сна /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake-%@ и, если оно указывает эту учётную запись, /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake (macOS запросит пароль администратора)\n• свой объект входа\n• свои настройки и ~/Library/Application Support/LidAwake\n• само приложение — оно будет перемещено в Корзину\n\nЗатем LidAwake завершит работу."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake was not uninstalled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake was not uninstalled."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake не удалён."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake was only partly uninstalled. These items remain:\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake was only partly uninstalled. These items remain:\n"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake удалён не полностью. Остались:\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake was uninstalled, but the app could not be moved to the Trash. Move it to the Trash yourself.\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake was uninstalled, but the app could not be moved to the Trash. Move it to the Trash yourself.\n\n"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake удалён, но приложение не удалось переместить в Корзину. Переместите его в Корзину вручную.\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LidAwake was uninstalled. Left /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake in place because it belongs to another account or has content LidAwake does not recognize.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake was uninstalled. Left /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake in place because it belongs to another account or has content LidAwake does not recognize."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LidAwake удалён. Файл /etc/sudoers.d/lidawake оставлен на месте: он принадлежит другой учётной записи или содержит то, что LidAwake не распознаёт."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No releases available yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No releases available yet"
